---
const stats = [
  { value: '~57%', label: 'of farmers report labour shortages affecting operations' },
  { value: '30%', label: 'of water used in agriculture is wasted to inefficiency' },
  { value: '1 in 3', label: 'crops at risk of delayed harvest due to workforce gaps' },
];
---

<section id="problem" class="section">
  <div class="container-content">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-4">The problem</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl">
        A workforce is disappearing. Resources are shrinking. Fields still need working.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-ink-500">
        Across the sector, the workforce that plants, tends, and harvests is
        shrinking and ageing — while the work remains. Meanwhile water and
        fertilizer costs rise, and precious inputs are lost to inefficiency. Farms
        are squeezed from both sides: fewer hands, costlier inputs, same fields.
      </p>
    </div>

    <dl class="mt-16 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-ink/5 bg-ink/5 sm:grid-cols-3">
      {stats.map((s) => (
        <div class="bg-cream px-6 py-10 sm:px-8">
          <dt class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold text-botanic sm:text-5xl">
            {s.value}
          </dt>
          <dd class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-500">{s.label}</dd>
        </div>
      ))}
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>